* A polynomial worked out by Horner's rule. The coefficients are in c,
* highest power first: here x*3 - 6·x*2 + 11·x - 6.
1.1 Set y = y·x + c(i).

2.1 Set y = 0.
2.2 Do part 1 for i = 0(1)n.
2.3 Type x, y in form 1.
Form 1:
x = _._   y = ___.___

Set n = 3.
Set c(0) = 1.
Set c(1) = -6.
Set c(2) = 11.
Set c(3) = -6.
Do part 2 for x = 0(.5)4.
